  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25600382",
      "title": "Summary",
      "sourceHash": "31566e267a9de68ba869ddb1b94d453660a982f4f4bced81e59e487e288128f4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 5.17,
          "en": "Now with that, that's it for this module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.17,
          "end": 9.32,
          "en": "We again practiced using Redux and more importantly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.32,
          "end": 12.06,
          "en": "we learned about a very important concept,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.06,
          "end": 14.75,
          "en": "we learned about Redux and side-effects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.75,
          "end": 16.85,
          "en": "and asynchronous code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.85,
          "end": 19.59,
          "en": "We learned that there are different places",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.59,
          "end": 22.21,
          "en": "where we can put this asynchronous code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.21,
          "end": 24.83,
          "en": "or where we can put such side-effects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.83,
          "end": 29.77,
          "en": "our components or action creators and we saw both in action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.77,
          "end": 32.48,
          "en": "We also saw how not to do it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.48,
          "end": 35.61,
          "en": "when we added all the data transformation code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.61,
          "end": 39.29,
          "en": "in the component which led to a very fat component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.29,
          "end": 41.09,
          "en": "and whilst that was working,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.09,
          "end": 45.47,
          "en": "it simply was not the idea behind using Redux.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.47,
          "end": 49.75,
          "en": "There, you should prefer reducers for data transformations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.75,
          "end": 52.7,
          "en": "and only put side-effects or async code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.7,
          "end": 55.42,
          "en": "into your components or action creators.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.42,
          "end": 57.32,
          "en": "So that's what we did thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.32,
          "end": 61.14,
          "en": "And we then also moved from component to action creator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.14,
          "end": 63.67,
          "en": "to learn about that concept as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.67,
          "end": 66.2,
          "en": "which allows us to keep our components lean",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.2,
          "end": 68.78999999999999,
          "en": "and focused on a couple of core tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.78999999999999,
          "end": 71.74,
          "en": "instead of doing all the heavy lifting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.74,
          "end": 74.8,
          "en": "Then at the end, we also had a look at the Redux DevTools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.8,
          "end": 77.12,
          "en": "and now the important piece of software",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.12,
          "end": 79.28,
          "en": "which allows us to fully understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.28,
          "end": 83.03999999999999,
          "en": "our Redux store and state, and what's going on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.03999999999999,
          "end": 84.64,
          "en": "where we can time travel",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.64,
          "end": 88.53999999999999,
          "en": "and where we can gain deep insights into Redux.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.53999999999999,
          "end": 91.99,
          "en": "And therefore, now after this module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.99,
          "end": 95.77000000000001,
          "en": "you learned a lot about Redux, a lot of advanced concepts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.77000000000001,
          "end": 98.41,
          "en": "and you are ready to use Redux",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.41,
          "end": 101.41,
          "en": "in any kind of application you might be building",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.41,
          "end": 105.15,
          "en": "with any kind of logic you might have in this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.15,
          "end": 108.47999999999999,
          "en": "including side-effects, HTTP requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.47999999999999,
          "end": 111.13300000000001,
          "en": "or any other kind of async code.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
